  {
   "id": "crymelight-399408@major-2026-11-05",
   "gameId": "crymelight-399408",
   "displayName": "[Important] Update and Apology Regarding the Delayed Steam® Release of CRYMELIGH",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-11-05T10:52:14.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As of Thursday, November 5, the pre-release review for the Steam® version has not yet been completed, and we are currently unable to confirm when the game will be available.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We sincerely apologize for the significant inconvenience and concern this has caused everyone who has been eagerly awaiting the release.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will set a new release date based on the progress of the review and announce it as soon as it is confirmed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The official Steam® demo will remain available until the full game launches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue working to bring the Steam® version to you as soon as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■ Related Sales and Bundles",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Steam® sale for CRYSTAR, which was arranged to coincide with the release of CRYMELIGHT, has started today as originally scheduled due to its prearranged Daily Deal schedule.[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/981750/\"]We will announce when the bundle with CRYMELIGHT will become available as soon as the timing is confirmed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also apologize for the wait for the collaboration bundles with Garden of Witches, Magical Princess, and Eternal Palace Sakura.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These bundles are scheduled to become available when CRYMELIGHT launches.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To everyone still waiting, please accept our sincere apologies. Thank you for your understanding and patience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
