  {
   "id": "crymelight-399408@major-2026-08-03",
   "gameId": "crymelight-399408",
   "displayName": "Battle Demo: Update Now Available",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-03T05:01:08.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We have released an update for the CRYMELIGHT Battle Demo, which has been available since approximately 1:00 a.m. JST on Saturday, August 1.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Based on the feedback and bug reports we have received, we have prioritized fixes and adjustments that could be addressed quickly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "♠ Today’s Main Updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue where the HP gauge did not decrease",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Partially revised translations in each supported language",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added a controls guide card and an end card",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Rebalanced enemy difficulty",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjusted the tutorial",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Made other minor adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "♠ Known Issue",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Items may disappear after performing certain actions",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are aware of this issue. As the fix requires additional time, it is not included in this update. We will continue to investigate and work on a solution.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "♠ Features in the Full Game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We apologize for causing concern about the full game by providing only simplified option settings in the Battle Demo.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The following frequently requested features have already been implemented in the full game or are scheduled to be implemented by launch, so please rest assured.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "【Options】",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Toggle controller vibration on or off",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Toggle screen shake on or off",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Mouse and keyboard controls",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "・Expanded option settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "【In-Game】",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Improved visibility",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjusted card effects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Changes to the dodge mechanics",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "└Adjusted to eliminate moments when dodge inputs are not registered",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "【Other】",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Further improvements to translation quality in all supported languages",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue working to improve the game and deliver the best possible full version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are also reviewing your other feedback and requests on an ongoing basis and considering possible actions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will share a further update once our plans have been finalized.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "▼Play the Battle Demo here",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3891160/CRYMELIGHT/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
